      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "MAIN TWO-SUBJECT H3 WORKFLOW. Upload both subject images. Start with a reviewed prompt from 05, or choose Generate with Ollama. Qwen reads original images; the H3 reference node has NO video VAE connected. Two separate full RefMods supply the visual latents exactly once, in picture order. Do not reconnect that VAE or add the same RefMods twice. RefMod compression, scrambling, repeated copies, retention fading and Turbo are OFF. The creators save references under models/refmods/identities; use 07_Backup_RefMods to download them. Full precision, large references and 25 steps cost memory and time. They do not guarantee identity retention."
      ]
    },
